{
  "sections": {
    "custom-page_landing-1": {
      "type": "custom--page_landing-1",
      "blocks": {
        "main_LCbfHn": {
          "type": "main",
          "settings": {
            "heading_1": "",
            "heading_2": "",
            "form": "<div class=\"klaviyo-form-RBCMwD\"></div>"
          }
        },
        "imagest_QcqgTj": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/UESDUdBu8_mid.jpg",
            "text": "<p>Absolutely love these sandals. They’re not only adorable, but beautifully made with so much attention to detail. The little ladybug design is even cuter in person, and they pair perfectly with spring outfits. They’re easy to get on and off, stay secure on little feet, and seem very comfortable for all-day wear. The quality feels excellent and durable, while still soft enough for a toddler.</p>",
            "label": "Alina A."
          }
        },
        "imagest_dhJrjr": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/5iZKQK4zVW_midddhhh.jpg",
            "text": "<p>The pop of red just adds so much happiness to every outfit. Love how this model protects their toes while playing, beautiful and versatile!</p>",
            "label": "Caroline W."
          }
        },
        "imagest_qgcaP9": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/kOJqpNgCn_mid_1.jpg",
            "text": "<p>These shoes are such a statement piece 🌸 I’ve already gotten so many compliments on them. I’m truly proud to wear them.</p>",
            "label": "Estelle B."
          }
        },
        "imagest_ax6tBq": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/GdvRSMxgWm_mid.jpg",
            "text": "<p>My daughter loves the sandals. She would love to wear them both at home and outside all the time. They have now become her favorite sandals, and she would like to wear them with all her outfits. They are truly beautiful. Great craftsmanship, a lovely color, really perfect for summer. We’re very happy.</p>",
            "label": "Sophia B."
          }
        },
        "imagest_K8t7Rf": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/41K2J3nV2_mid_a7fda514-508b-4769-87ac-14dd2f5d8f4b.jpg",
            "text": "<p>Absolutely stunning shoes ! So<br/>Well made and the perfect fit.We love ours!</p>",
            "label": "Annouska T."
          }
        },
        "imagest_FjAAyW": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/frl2DmIBe_mid.jpg",
            "text": "<p>The colour, the bow detail, the fit,everything about this sandal is just right! What a sweet shoe for my daughter. It’s a great sandal<br/>for year round special occasions, you can wear bare foot or add socks or stockings. Adorable, very happy with these!</p>",
            "label": "Bri H."
          }
        },
        "imagest_88NwMa": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/dWaoU1RpL_mid.jpg",
            "text": "<p>My little girl’s favorite sandals!</p>",
            "label": "Amber C."
          }
        },
        "82bd0b58-c3c2-4433-8f6c-cfd15d8d27fe": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/x8hF9cVgYI_mid.jpg",
            "text": "<p>This pair of shoes is such an adorable addition to my baby's wardrobe. They are well made and durable, but not overly stiff which is great as she learns to walk. Cute and very well designed too!</p>",
            "label": "Andrea A."
          }
        },
        "imagest_krixnx": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/wK5dyd7cv_mid.jpg",
            "text": "<p>What a beautiful pair of shoes! Our family has many pairs of shoes and these are some of my very favorites. I love that they're durable without being clunky. They're a staple in my children's wardrobe.</p>",
            "label": "Andrea A."
          }
        },
        "imagest_DfCVK9": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/wild_strawberries_classic_sandal.jpg",
            "text": "<p>We could not love these shoes more! My daughter is in love with her \"strawberry shoes”. The quality is impeccable, and the shoes fit true to size. The durability, quality, comfort, and fit keeps us coming back for more!<br/>Highly recommend!</p>",
            "label": "Lindsey S."
          }
        },
        "imagest_KGFU6b": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/4YV9TaKnl8_mid_8f963d2a-839b-4a16-9029-e3d43f65f1fd.jpg",
            "text": "<p>Perfect shoes for a new walker! The velcro makes leaving the house quick and easy. Cognac leather is incredibly soft and comfortable, and the front protection is great for all the kicking. He really enjoys wearing them. 😊</p>",
            "label": "Elena C."
          }
        },
        "imagest_Udcj8z": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/4dZlwDlFk_mid_8becebc1-37d3-43a0-95a9-f51615f517db.jpg",
            "text": "<p>Adore! The softest shoes ever, first we had Sahara Suede and now we love Leopard🤎</p>",
            "label": "Dajana K."
          }
        },
        "imagest_y39K6k": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/LqxI2aAk3_mid.jpg",
            "text": "<p>The cream t-bar shoes are gorgeous! A classic design in the softest leather and so comfy for little feet! The velcro buckle makes it super easy for my 3 yr old to put on her own shoes and she loves that! Excellent quality!</p>",
            "label": "Shanna S."
          }
        },
        "imagest_3e9DYe": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Esfir_V.jpg",
            "text": "<p>These kids’ shoes are just lovely! 🤎 Made from genuine leather and designed with a square shape to support healthy foot development. They have a beautiful golden-ish color and are very high-quality. Stylish, comfortable, and perfect for little feet 👣</p>",
            "label": "Esfir V."
          }
        },
        "imagest_4y9nj8": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/z3SphgenD_mid.jpg",
            "text": "<p>Love this shoes on my little girl so much!</p>",
            "label": "Edyta K."
          }
        },
        "imagest_Gqtc3M": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/lzIhzZtUB_mid.jpg",
            "text": "<p>Second year wearing these gorgeous boots. The softest buttery leather, super comfy and super cute! Best boots we’ve ever owned!</p>",
            "label": "Ruby W."
          }
        },
        "imagest_kzQEnJ": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/landing_page_recenzija_3.jpg",
            "text": "<p>My boy loves these trainers. Stylish, comfortable and practical. They are a true to size fit and excellent quality. The shape gives good ankle support and comfort for exploring and play.</p>",
            "label": "Natalie C."
          }
        },
        "imagest_BGzjNT": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/htZzAUQu3B_mid.jpg",
            "text": "<p>We love our new shoes! Totally flexible and so great for little feet! And the look is really nice too!</p>",
            "label": "Jasmin B."
          }
        },
        "imagest_cmp3y4": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/jkinLC-AmJ_mid.jpg",
            "text": "<p>We love the shoes as always. They have a great fit, and with the Velcro it’s easy for my son to put them on by himself.</p>",
            "label": "Janni L."
          }
        },
        "imagest_kJXCVm": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Leah_B.jpg",
            "text": "<p>I am so impressed with the quality and craftsmanship. They are so well made and beautiful. The perfect brown. They will keep my little one's feet warm all winter long and she adores them. True to size.</p>",
            "label": "Leah B."
          }
        },
        "imagest_6xqiVh": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/landing_page_recenzija_2.jpg",
            "text": "<p>We love these cozy boots! They are a beautiful design that are so convenient to put with the velcro closure. The wool lining makes them so warm, comfortable and cozy. We absolutely love this new patent leather colour.  Our favourite winter boots each season.</p>",
            "label": "Shanna S."
          }
        },
        "imagest_TMYxGF": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Kati_H.jpg",
            "text": "<p>I absolutely love my boots❤️ <br/>They’re beautifully made, incredibly comfortable, and the leather is soft yet durable.</p>",
            "label": "Kati H."
          }
        },
        "imagest_Thm8kQ": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Edyta_K.jpg",
            "text": "<p>Gorgeous boots in most beautiful color 😍<br/>Highly recommended ❤️</p>",
            "label": "Edyta K."
          }
        },
        "imagest_W4ARAa": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Inna_R.jpg",
            "text": "<p>These boots are such a standout piece! Stylish yet timeless, they instantly elevate any outfit. My son loves wearing them, and I love how versatile they are. They are perfect for both everyday adventures and dressing up a little. A true statement pair we’ll be reaching for all season long. ❤️</p>",
            "label": "Inna R."
          }
        },
        "imagest_dL3Gjr": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Amadeus_J.jpg",
            "text": "<p>These super cute patent leather shoes are so beautiful. Wilma looks so chic, and we often get compliments on these cute shoes. The shoes are very high quality and incredibly lightweight. We absolutely recommend them. ❤️</p>",
            "label": "Amadeus J."
          }
        },
        "imagest_jEyyMB": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Alina_A.jpg",
            "text": "<p>My toddler is absolutely obsessed with these boots! The little woodland details are so fun—she points out the mushrooms and leaves every time she puts them on. They’re super comfy, easy to slip on, and go with everything from play outfits to something a bit more dressed up. She loves stomping around in them, and I love that they’re sturdy and well-made. Truly the cutest fall boots we’ve ever had!</p>",
            "label": "Alina A."
          }
        },
        "imagest_tfkNQT": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/lq7SW8M4g6_mid.jpg",
            "text": "<p>Third pair of t-bars in a row for our 2,5 years old. The fit it just amazing and we fell in love with the new fall glow.</p>",
            "label": "Kim V."
          }
        },
        "imagest_PXYaRL": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Emma_A.jpg",
            "text": "<p>Everything I dreamed of; quality and design are equally well done. Such a craftmanship, thank you.</p>",
            "label": "Emma A."
          }
        },
        "816d196f-37f6-47cb-9599-aab118b40f1d": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Custom_Size_1_eb0127c9-9934-44aa-bfae-07ffd1732711.jpg",
            "text": "<p>These are my son’s favorite shoes! They match with everything and he says they’re  the most comfortable pair of shoes he owns.  Petit Nord is the best brand of kids’ shoes IMO. The workmanship and quality is unmatched and they last through the seasons.</p>",
            "label": "Susan P."
          }
        },
        "imagest_GcQJ9b": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/nBPWiEF9D__mid.jpg",
            "text": "<p>The most adorable shoes for your little ones. They are so soft & comfortable for baby’s first steps. Also the velcro definitely makes them the perfect shoes, they are so easy to put on. I absolutely love them!</p>",
            "label": "Tania C."
          }
        },
        "8ffa5a29-000f-47f1-a955-54d941ece793": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/S6b8Drf9s.jpg",
            "text": "<p>Stunning boots with excellent quality. Little details are gorgeous. Comfortable and best quality leather as Petit Nord footwear always has.</p>",
            "label": "Kairit S."
          }
        },
        "imagest_K6y3xw": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/sweetheart_sandal_19266c54-3516-4856-9182-4bbae1b570ce.jpg",
            "text": "<p>Another beautiful pair from Petit Nord — the perfect spring and summer sandals for little feet. Soft leather, timeless design, and impeccable craftsmanship make these a standout. They’re easy for my toddler to slip on and off and durable enough to last the entire season and beyond. We absolutely adore this brand.</p>",
            "label": "Alina A."
          }
        },
        "imagest_dgV4Bq": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/diamond_starter_sandal.jpg",
            "text": "<p>The quality is lovely and made to last even with lots of outside play. My toddler is able to put these on himself due to the velcro closure and prefers to wear these and his other pair of Petit Nord sandals over the rest of his shoes. They seem comfortable to him, and he has worn them right out of the box without any issues. I would definitely recommend them!</p>",
            "label": "Courtney P."
          }
        },
        "imagest_egFMfF": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/x3lOSRy14r_mid.jpg",
            "text": "<p>My daughter adores them! They're beautiful, comfortable, and true to size.</p>",
            "label": "Luiza S."
          }
        },
        "imagest_Cm4qw6": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/OhXQFdsme_mid.jpg",
            "text": "<p>Pretty much my little girls dream shoes. The color and design are perfect and the quality is fabulous</p>",
            "label": "Natalie"
          }
        },
        "imagest_cCQWwR": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/7rpc8Pl6oG_mid.jpg",
            "text": "<p>Magnificent! The quality is incredible and the shoes are soft and pretty! Perfect for the whole Summer!</p>",
            "label": "Laura"
          }
        },
        "imagest_beBDxM": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Scallop_Velcro_Boot-Low_Boot_Shoes-21772_A-Cherry_Patent_104-5.jpg",
            "text": "<p>Our oldest daughters choice and I get why! Red shiny. But for me as a Mom also very valuable that they are firm and water resistant. Can’t wait for all the fall memories being made in these red shoes.</p>",
            "label": "Kim V."
          }
        },
        "739e1f95-bd81-414d-9e1c-84ea4f3f8e29": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/UGuX9-FRJ_mid.jpg",
            "text": "<p>So beautiful & so comfortable! It’s the perfect everyday pair to wear. I love how easy the shoes are to put on, my boys love wearing them. Great quality!</p>",
            "label": "Tania C."
          }
        },
        "imagest_8jwdTz": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/landing_page_recenzija_1.jpg",
            "text": "<p>Absolutely adored by my 6 year old. She loves that they are sparkly and the colour. Quick and easy to put on. Beautiful details and design, great boots as always, too quality.</p>",
            "label": "Kairit S."
          }
        },
        "imagest_J86PXK": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/11A7Uls-bt_mid.jpg",
            "text": "<p>Every single embroidery is magical. With these ankle boots, Autumn can come. Whether with fine stockings or cuddly tights. Always an eye-catcher :)</p>",
            "label": "Christina B."
          }
        },
        "imagest_McWnCm": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/landing_page_recenzija_4.webp",
            "text": "<p>These are our absolute favourite winter boots! So beautifully made and perfect for cold outdoor play. The natural wool lining is just what I was looking for to keep my little ones feet toasty warm.  The Plum colour we choose is so stunning!</p>",
            "label": "Shanna S."
          }
        },
        "imagest_PEbdzr": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/4vdWpa-1rU_mid.jpg",
            "text": "<p>Beautiful shoes in a beautiful hazelnut color. Very good quality of workmanship, light shoes, very soft and comfortable. Additionally, the beautiful design makes them definitely worth buying! 🤎</p>",
            "label": "Ewa"
          }
        },
        "0e3b5325-15b0-48d5-a12d-4366f227553f": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/qpJEL0sv0_mid_9ae7561b-8185-475f-953e-bd5baf117047.jpg",
            "text": "<p>Super warm boots and daughter had no complaints. They are easy to put on and easy to take off. Will keep little ones feet warm all winter. </p>",
            "label": "Yana L."
          }
        },
        "d8cb9ceb-1df0-4a59-9dcc-8b6164882d5f": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/SneakerCognacConfetti_mariemunktranberg_1.jpg",
            "text": "<p>“My little bug can’t get over her new shoes from PetitNord. Would recommend to anyone, packs a bunch of benefits. </p>",
            "label": "@label"
          }
        },
        "imagest_wWbMHi": {
          "type": "imagest",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/9nqyOe_ai_mid.jpg",
            "text": "<p>Wonderful design, super compfy and just a perfect fit! Love this sandals and enjoy them every day 🥰</p>",
            "label": "Anna L."
          }
        }
      },
